to run this you need to install:
pip install torch torchvision huggingface_hub pillow

relevant documentaion:

gerbage detection model:
https://huggingface.co/keremberke/yolov5m-garbage

image database:
https://universe.roboflow.com/material-identification/garbage-classification-3/dataset/2

robot docs:
https://wiki.hiwonder.com/projects/ArmPi_Pro/en/latest/



sequenceDiagram
    participant Robot as Robot Arm
    participant Main as Main Controller
    participant Vision as Vision Manager
    participant BinDet as Bin Detector
    participant Mapper as Coordinate Mapper
    participant Cam as USB Camera
    
    Note over Robot,Cam: STARTUP PHASE
    Main->>Robot: Move to home position
    Main->>Cam: Capture calibration frame
    Cam-->>Main: Frame
    Main->>BinDet: detect_orange_bin(frame)
    BinDet->>BinDet: HSV filtering
    BinDet->>BinDet: Find largest orange contour
    BinDet-->>Main: Bin centroid (480, 350)
    Main->>Mapper: pixel_to_world(480, 350)
    Mapper-->>Main: Bin coords (-12.3, 14.5, 10.0)
    Main->>Main: Store bin location
    
    Note over Robot,Cam: MAIN SORTING LOOP
    loop For each item
        Main->>Cam: Capture frame
        Cam-->>Main: Frame
        Main->>Vision: detect_objects(frame)
        Vision->>Vision: YOLO inference
        Vision-->>Main: Plastic bbox (120,150,280,310)
        Main->>Main: Calculate centroid (200, 230)
        Main->>Mapper: pixel_to_world(200, 230)
        Mapper-->>Main: Plastic coords (5.2, 18.7, 2.0)
        
        Main->>Robot: pickup(5.2, 18.7, 2.0)
        Robot-->>Main: Item grabbed
        
        Main->>Robot: drop(-12.3, 14.5, 10.0)
        Robot-->>Main: Item sorted
        
        Main->>Robot: move_to_home()
    end
